course: dictionary
lesson: 7313
title: Place: many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: One small word can mean many things. Place can be a noun or a verb, and the words around it show you which meaning to choose. «I place one cup on the table» uses place as a verb: it means to put something somewhere carefully.
explain: Read the clues. «On time means different things in different places» is about locations, so here place means an area or spot. «First place» in a race is a position in a list. Look at the words next to place to decide.
explain: Check your meaning by swapping it into the sentence. Does «a quiet place» make sense with place meaning spot? Yes. Does «place the cup carefully» make sense with place meaning put? Yes. If it fits, you have found the meaning.
fact: Place can be a noun (a spot, a town, a home, a position) or a verb (to put something somewhere carefully).
fact: «A quiet place» means a particular area or spot.
fact: «First place» means the top position in a race or a list.
fact: In maths, the place of a digit gives its value: in 45, the 4 is in the tens place.
fact: «Take place» means to happen, and «in place of» means instead of.
exercise: «I place one cup on the table.» What does place mean here? | The value of a digit in maths | *To put something somewhere carefully | A town where people live | A position in a race
exercise: In the number 45, what does the tens place tell you? | The value of the 5, which is five | *The value of the 4, which is forty | The name of the number | The position of the number in a race
exercise: «She came first place in the race.» What does first place mean? | *The top position | To put something down carefully | A home | A quiet spot
test: «Come to my place after school.» What does place mean here? | A spot in a field | A position in a list | *A home | To put something down
test: «On time means different things in different places.» What does places mean? | Things put down carefully | *Areas or locations | Races or positions | Maths digits
exam: Read: «The robot will place the box on the shelf.» What does place mean? | The tens place in maths | A town | *To put something somewhere carefully | A position in a race
